:: Decision4
<div class="novel"><aside class="scene-side"><<ownStage 3>><<ownStats>><div class="charge">Decision 4 of 10</div></aside><section class="dialogue"><div class="eyebrow">The Ride That Wouldn’t Autocorrect</div><h1>Question round 1 · understand</h1><p class="speaker">Young · fictionalized encounter</p><div class="story-beats"><p>The next source card names Young’s proposal. You have time to ask one question before the conversation moves on. All three paths will remain available for optional reading at the end.</p></div><div class="after-beats"><<ownSource "B">><div class="choice-heading">Your next move</div><<ownChoice "mix" "What does code-meshing ask a writer to try?">>
<<ownChoice "rules" "Does this mean conventions no longer matter?">>
<<ownChoice "reader" "What work could a reader do?">></div></section></div>

:: Consequence4
<div class="novel"><aside class="scene-side"><<ownStage 3 true>><<ownStats>></aside><section class="dialogue"><h1>Question round 1 · understand</h1><div class="story-beats"><<ownConsequence 3>></div><div class="after-beats"><<ownQuestionSource 3>><<button "Continue">><<goto "Decision5">><</button>></div></section></div>

:: Decision5
<div class="novel"><aside class="scene-side"><<ownStage 4>><<ownStats>><div class="charge">Decision 5 of 10</div></aside><section class="dialogue"><div class="eyebrow">The Ride That Wouldn’t Autocorrect</div><h1>Question round 2 · challenge</h1><p class="speaker">Mei · magazine editor</p><div class="story-beats"><p>Mei raises her hand. “I’m editing this week’s issue, not a future world where every reader already understands every expression. What should I do by Friday?” Choose the concern you most need to explore.</p></div><div class="after-beats"><<ownSource "D">><div class="choice-heading">Your next move</div><<ownChoice "clarity" "What if the reader genuinely cannot understand a phrase?">>
<<ownChoice "power" "What if the evaluator still insists on a single standard?">>
<<ownChoice "dissent" "Can I question the argument without dismissing it?">></div></section></div>

